Hello,

The btrfs filesystem has been around for more than a year now, and
distributions start shipping experimental support for it (end user as
well as enterprise ones).

But it is still in the works: do you use it? What do you like about
it? What would you want?

If you are interested in giving your opinion, here is a quick survey
you can fill to share your thoughts:

http://www.surveygizmo.com/s3/376617/btrfs-usage

